@startuml decorator_gof_sequence
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true

title Dekorator GoF - sekwencja

participant Client
participant DecoratorB
participant DecoratorA
participant ConcreteComponent

Client -> DecoratorB: Operation()
DecoratorB -> DecoratorA: Operation()
DecoratorA -> ConcreteComponent: Operation()
ConcreteComponent --> DecoratorA: base result
DecoratorA --> DecoratorB: result + A
DecoratorB --> Client: result + A + B
@enduml
